  "description": "TN21, the 4.6 worked example (shipped N = 3). The Street cross of tn11_04a; then the arm cell (1,2), a Street record with 2 connections whose exit leads straight into the 4-way intersection at (2,2), becomes a tunnel cell: a portal occupant of a tunnel type at (1,2) gets a tunnel record and the rebuild sets wormhole bit 2 there (4.2 step 5, 4.8). The start cell gets the same checks as every other cell, so a tunnel start cell is not extended: its search ends at once with best = N + 1 and it keeps its table value 0x3C23D70A (100), not 0x3C4CCCCC (80.00001). The intersection keeps 0x3C6A0EA1, the other arm cells keep 0x3C4CCCCC and 0x3C360B61; (0,2) reaches the tunnel cell but not through it (TN5), so it keeps 0x3C23D70A as well. Hand-derived from 4.6.",
